---
// /about/ (rebuild plan §4.2). The one page where the office may describe
// itself (VOICE rule 6), kept to facts with a source each. Staff, partners
// and funders arrive with the content collections (Phase 4).
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import { url } from '../../lib/paths';
---
<Base short="About"
      description="The Montana Climate Office at the University of Montana: what it is, and how to reach it.">
  <!-- Copy drafted with AI assistance; needs MCO staff review before launch (UM AI disclosure). -->
  <div class="prose">
    <h1>About the Montana Climate Office</h1>

    {/* Designation: mco-website/_pages/about/about.md ("In 2006 Governor
        Schweitzer designated the Montana Climate Office, at the University
        of Montana, as the official state climate office"). */}
    <p>
      The Montana Climate Office is Montana's official state climate office.
      Governor Schweitzer designated it in 2006.
    </p>

    {/* College and town: the site footer, owner decision of 22 Oct 2026
        (rebuild plan Phase 1 item 3; DECISIONS D15 postal address). */}
    <p>
      The office is part of the W.A. Franke College of Forestry &amp; Conservation at the
      University of Montana, in Missoula.
    </p>

    {/* Operates the Mesonet: mco-website/index.md ("stations that the MCO
        operates across Montana"). The tools: src/lib/tools.ts, repos under
        mt-climate-office (phase-0-report §3). */}
    <p>
      It runs the Montana Mesonet and builds the data tools linked from
      the <a href={url('conditions/')}>Conditions</a>, <a href={url('drought/')}>Drought</a>
      and <a href={url('mesonet/')}>Mesonet</a> pages.
    </p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    {/* Address and email: the site footer (rebuild plan Phase 1 item 3). */}
    <p>
      Email <a href="mailto:state.climatologist@umontana.edu">state.climatologist@umontana.edu</a>.
    </p>
    <address>
      Montana Climate Office<br>
      W.A. Franke College of Forestry &amp; Conservation<br>
      University of Montana<br>
      Missoula, MT 59812
    </address>
  </div>
</Base>
